### Créer un ticket
POST http://localhost:3000/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "visitType": "consultation",
  "patientType": "php",
  "patientName": "Jean KAMDEM",
  "patientPhone": "+237690000000"
}

### Obtenir la file d'attente PHP
GET http://localhost:3000/api/tickets/queue/accueil_php
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### Obtenir les positions
GET http://localhost:3000/api/tickets/positions/accueil_php
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE